  "body": "The e-witness instrument-consumption lane earns its currency: **SuperInstance/delta-shape#1** merged 2026-09-30T19:31:08Z (merge `57c07426`) with the SuperInstance/quilt-ewitness citation load-bearing on main — byte-pinned vendored `eproc.mjs` (@ `61b9e04`, sha256 `aad90ac5…`), `witnessDrift()` hash-gating before trust, by-name citations in README + SOURCE.txt + esign.mjs.\n\nHonest history in the commit: this edge was booked PENDING twice (7ddd151 — lost in a /tmp wipe; quilt-tools#31 / `812a644` — later reset off main, main now at `58e2a18`). The merge outran the booking, so this lands the edge directly at VERIFIED with the merge as receipt — the aw-jev-kat precedent, with the booking chased by the merge instead of preceding it.\n\n- 18 edges: **14 VERIFIED · 4 PENDING**; delta-shape enters the view at full VERIFIED mass (6th to-node born after seeding); quilt-ewitness is a from-node.\n- Pins: 114/114 offline green, 115/115 live green (incl. provenance audit of all 14 receipts) — run against this branch.\n- View: 13 mass-carrying repos; delta-shape ranks first among the single-VERIFIED tie.",
